      "writtenOn": "2019-03-11T20:00:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I have no doubts that this fixes the problem, I am curios if this is the best way to fix it. Adding a check in the flow is going to slow things down, even if very insignificantly.\n\nWhat check got removed? Can you please comment on the bug, can we discuss the options there?",
